WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.162
Lab 1 needs PowerShell 7 with
Pester, in the kit's folder.

2
00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:08.802
Contoso has two WAF policies: one
on its portal application gateway,

3
00:00:08.802 --> 00:00:11.537
and one on its portal Front Door profile.

4
00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:15.087
A second Front Door profile,
for careers, has none.

5
00:00:15.087 --> 00:00:19.263
Step 1 runs the check: one of
three internet-facing endpoints

6
00:00:19.263 --> 00:00:23.188
is behind a WAF in prevention,
and the plan file is written.

7
00:00:23.188 --> 00:00:25.451
Step 2 reads each policy.

8
00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:28.238
The gateway's policy
is still in detection.

9
00:00:28.238 --> 00:00:31.763
The Front Door policy blocks,
but has no bot rule set.

10
00:00:31.763 --> 00:00:34.460
Both are on Default
Rule Set two point one.
